	(descr "Taoglas GVLB258.A single-feed stacked L1/L5 ceramic patch, 25x25x8.12 mm, feed pin 0.8 mm on the centre line 2.5 mm off centre. Land and clearances per datasheet SPE-21-8-082-G sec. 4.2-4.3: 1.0 mm plated hole, 1.2 mm top pad, 2.2 mm bottom pad; no copper within 3.0 mm dia on the top and inner layers, 3.5 mm dia on the bottom. Tuned by Taoglas on a 70x70 mm ground plane (https://www.taoglas.com/datasheets/GVLB258.A.pdf)")
